  "features": [],
  "description_text": "Unleash your wild side with the Leopard Print Transparent Phone Case. Designed with a bold black leopard pattern on a clear base, this case adds a trendy and fierce look to your phone while keeping its natural beauty visible. Made with durable material, it offers everyday protection against scratches, drops, and dust – without compromising on style. ✨ Features: • Stylish black leopard print design on a transparent case • Slim, lightweight & comfortable grip • Scratch-resistant & shock-absorbent protection • Raised edges to protect camera & screen • Perfect blend of fashion and functionality • Compatible with multiple iPhone models",
  "description_html": "<div>Unleash your wild side with the Leopard Print Transparent Phone Case. Designed with a bold black leopard pattern on a clear base, this case adds a trendy and fierce look to your phone while keeping its natural beauty visible. Made with durable material, it offers everyday protection against scratches, drops, and dust – without compromising on style.</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>✨ Features:</div>\n<div><span> • Stylish black leopard print design on a transparent case</span></div>\n<div><span> • Slim, lightweight &amp; comfortable grip</span></div>\n<div><span> • Scratch-resistant &amp; shock-absorbent protection</span></div>\n<div><span> • Raised edges to protect camera &amp; screen</span></div>\n<div><span> • Perfect blend of fashion and functionality</span></div>\n<div><span> • Compatible with multiple iPhone models</span></div>"
